WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,900
Don't you have anything to say to me? You're not telling the truth.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,300
If you don't come today

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:15,640
I almost forgot you came here

4
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:26,430
Been gone for so long

5
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:38,230
Do you want to get back together with Lin Yu again? It’s time to close the shop.
